{
  "message": "Let's address the network and data issues step by step. First, please change your network mode preference to allow your phone to connect to 4G or 5G networks, which are required for reliable MMS and data. After that, enable mobile data on your phone. Once both steps are done, let me know if you can send MMS messages or if you notice any changes."
