{
  "message": "I understand this is frustrating, and I appreciate your patience. The next step is to check if Wi-Fi Calling is enabled, as it can sometimes interfere with MMS. Please check if Wi-Fi Calling is ON, and if it is, turn it OFF. Let me know if this helps with sending MMS messages."
